    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to believe anyone can actually help when the cycle is this deep. everyone always talks about \"holding on\" but they don't get how heavy it is. it feels like everyone is just telling me to keep suffering for no reason. doesn't it just seem more logical to just find peace instead of fighting a losing battle?",
